# Crisis lead

You lead the response until normal service returns.

:::checklist
- [ ] Confirm the outage with :contact[it-helpdesk]
- [ ] Call :contact[communications-lead] and agree the first message
- [ ] Open the [DR playbook](../playbook.en.md) and start the decision log
- [ ] Check in with the DR team every 30 minutes
- [ ] Declare the end of the outage
:::

If you can't act as crisis lead, hand over by phone and say so in the decision log.
